17090/extras/5519d0d215f3a6f356a00446fc145756.poster.avif?t=1755251991\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817090/extras/5519d0d215f3a6f356a00446fc145756.webm?t=1755251991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817090/extras/5519d0d215f3a6f356a00446fc145756.mp4?t=1755251991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
